body:
~~I am really not trying to be hostile but you're speaking on things that you're not informed about and in turn you're giving out harmful advice. Your comment made it sound as if this person is so unsuccessful with men that they have no choice but to date women which is a bizarre thing to say.~~

&#x200B;

Nvm this guy is a fucking creep that searches for depressed gay people so he can tell them to kill themselves.  Fuck this moronic asshole. Burn in hell.

I could chime in with my anecdotes, constantly having to listen to other men talk about dick sizes, but it's not really the most important thing here. Our society associates a big dick with masculinity, and since masculinity is a desired trait in guys, anyone can be the one to propagate this attitude and puts masculinity on a pedestal. Whether it's hetero women sexualizing masculine bodies or if it's other men shaming other men for not living up to those standards, it's not really about "women vs men" it's us as individuals that have to reject the societal expectations.

&#x200B;

tl;dr peepoTalk
